{
    "title": "\ubbf8\uc2a4\ud130\ube14\ub8e8 - \uc6f9\ud230, \ub9cc\ud654, \uc18c\uc124\uc571",
    "description": "<strong>\ud83d\ude06 Mr. Blue\u2019s fun with no exit!</strong>\r\n\u2022 Mr. Blue\u2019s exclusive webtoon that is too good to know alone\r\n\u2022 Unlimited viewing of high-quality premium martial arts comics\r\n\u2022 Latest novels, popular animation original comics events\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83d\udd25Only at Mr. Blue! Popular Exclusive Webtoon</strong>\r\n- The work of your life you\u2019ve been looking for is here, at Mr. Blue!\r\n- Enjoy the fun of a variety of genres, including BL, romance, drama, and thriller action.\r\n- Eol/Navit \u300eThe Favorite Has Appeared?!\u300f, Dakto \u300eBobitbe\u300f, Huung/Damrein \u300eTiger's Den\u300f, Bobae/Nabit \u300eBurler\u300f, Dasik \u300eBreathing the Same Air\u300f, etc.\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83d\udcd6 NEW The new work is excellent! Latest novel</strong>\r\n- Fun to choose from, massive novel updates 365 days a year\r\n- Immerse yourself in new stories every day with exceptional benefit EVENTs!\r\n- BEST Panmu Novel: Dayu \u300eMurim is a chance to me\u300f, North America Soul \u300ePlum Blossom Swordsman\u300f, Wu Gak \u300eBukgeomjeon\u300f, Wangsimni Writer \u300eLotto No. 1 Director After Divorce\u300f, Glove \u300eOriental Doctor Leveling Up\u300f, Sangyeong \u300eChaebol House\u300f The youngest son\u300f\r\n- BEST Romance Novel: Mooncake \u300eAdult Baby\u300f, Scent Wind \u300eColorless Marriage\u300f, Joo-ari \u300eThe Reason Ophelia Can't Leave the Dukedom\u300f, Bora-young \u300eSignature\u300f, Badger Gukbap \u300eThe only way to break the curse is with you \u2018Only a Contact\u2019, Ham Cho-rong \u300eCrypt Princess\u300f\r\n\r\n<strong>\u2694\ufe0fThe choice of true experts! Mr. Blue Martial Arts Comics</strong>\r\n- The more you watch, the better! Completely unlimited martial arts comics with a flat-rate ticket!\r\n- Meet the premium martial arts of the four great martial arts kings Hwang Seong, Ya Seol-rok, Sima Dal, and Ha Seung-nam.\r\n- Hwangseong popular comics: \u300eTaegeuk Wujon\u300f, \u300eSaryu Samurai\u300f, \u300eShinma\u300f, \u300eStaff\u300f, \u300eGolden Wife\u300f, etc.\r\n- Yasulloc popular cartoon: \u300eAh! Hyeongsanpa\u300f, \u300eGoe\u300f, \u300eYeomra\u300f, \u300eTaesanggyoju Susu\u300f, \u300eGeongon Ilwol\u300f, etc.\r\n- Sima Dal\u2019s popular comics: \u300eWhispering invincible\u300f, \u300eGhostly Scholar\u300f, \u300eKwonsin\u300f, \u300eGod of Fire\u300f, \u300ePaedist Myth\u300f, etc.\r\n- Ha Seung-nam\u2019s popular comics: \u300eInvincible Ronin\u300f, \u300eNoklim Maje\u300f, \u300eThe Legend of the Pot Lid\u300f, Invincible Series, Goltong Series, etc.\r\n\r\n<strong>\u2764\ufe0fA bundle of works that suit your taste! Special theater exclusively for BL</strong>\r\n- The BL restaurant that everyone knows about, Mr. Blue, the BL craftsman!\r\n- Select and enjoy the number that suits your taste among various BL genres.\r\n- BL Webtoon BEST: Phoebe \u300eUnintentional Love Story\u300f, Phoebe \u300eWhere the Wind Stays\u300f, Gideed \u300eFlowers Under the Lantern\u300f, Witch Ginger \u300eSpring Day is Coming\u300f, Bart/Logout \u300eYouth Flows\u300f, Kichi Uekawa \u300e Love and Desire Training\u2019, etc.\r\n- BEST BL novels: Ginger \u300eTrace of the Margin\u300f, Elenian \u300eFrom the Day I Gave Up Unrequited Love\u300f, Flona \u300eDefine the Relationship\u300f, Bakbe \u300eSecret Keeper\u300f, Anor Isil \u300eThe Secret Life of the Demon King\u300f, of \u300eMu Moon Night, etc.\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83d\udd51Popular works you want to see! Free if you wait</strong>\r\n- The most awaited time in everyday life, waiting time!\r\n- Wait for the designated time and watch the next episode for free.\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83d\udd14Ding dong! Real-time notification of updates on your favorite works</strong>\r\n- Enjoy new works faster than anyone else!\r\n- Clicking the \u2018Save\u2019 button on the work page makes viewing easier.\r\n\r\n<strong>\ud83c\udf81Gift box coupons pouring in every day</strong>\r\n- My own gift box filled with free coupon benefits!\r\n- Find the piece that suits your taste with coupons paid 365 days a year.\r\n\r\n<strong>\u25b6 Mr. Blue Customer Center</strong>\r\n- Phone: 080-333-3370 (Weekdays 09:30~18:30)\r\n- Email: webmaster@mrblue.com\r\n\r\n<strong>\u25b6 Information on access rights used in the Mr. Blue app</strong>\r\n[Required access rights]\r\n- The Mr. Blue app does not use the required access permissions.\r\n\r\n[Optional access rights]\r\n- Notification: Used to receive Mr. Blue message notifications.\r\n- Storage space: Used to attach images for 1:1 inquiries.\r\n- You can use the Mr. Blue service even if you do not agree to the optional access rights.\r\n\r\n[How to revoke access rights]\r\n- Operating system 6.0 or higher: Settings > Application Manager > Select app > Permissions > Access permission can be revoked\r\n- Operating system below 6.0: Access rights cannot be revoked, so they can be revoked by deleting the app.\r\n\r\n\u203b You can use the service even if you do not agree to the optional access permission, but the provision of functions that require the permission may be restricted.\r\n\u203b Even if you do not agree to the optional access permission, you can use the service except for functions related to that permission.\r\n\u203b If you are using Android version lower than 6.0, you cannot set optional access rights individually, so we recommend upgrading to Android 6.0 or higher.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<strong>\ud83d\ude06 Mr. Blue\u2019s fun with no exit!</strong><br>\u2022 Mr. Blue\u2019s exclusive webtoon that is too good to know alone<br>\u2022 Unlimited viewing of high-quality premium martial arts comics<br>\u2022 Latest novels, popular animation original comics events<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udd25Only at Mr. Blue! Popular Exclusive Webtoon</strong><br>- The work of your life you\u2019ve been looking for is here, at Mr. Blue!<br>- Enjoy the fun of a variety of genres, including BL, romance, drama, and thriller action.<br>- Eol/Navit \u300eThe Favorite Has Appeared?!\u300f, Dakto \u300eBobitbe\u300f, Huung/Damrein \u300eTiger&#39;s Den\u300f, Bobae/Nabit \u300eBurler\u300f, Dasik \u300eBreathing the Same Air\u300f, etc.<br><br><strong>\ud83d\udcd6 NEW The new work is excellent! Latest novel</strong><br>- Fun to choose from, massive novel updates 365 days a year<br>- Immerse yourself in new stories every day with exceptional benefit EVENTs!<br>- BEST Panmu Novel: Dayu \u300eMurim is a chance to me\u300f, North America Soul \u300ePlum Blossom Swordsman\u300f, Wu Gak \u300eBukgeomjeon\u300f, Wangsimni Writer \u300eLotto No. 1 Director After Divorce\u300f, Glove \u300eOriental Doctor Leveling Up\u300f, Sangyeong \u300eChaebol House\u300f The youngest son\u300f<br>- BEST Romance Novel: Mooncake \u300eAdult Baby\u300f, Scent Wind \u300eColorless Marriage\u300f, Joo-ari \u300eThe Reason Ophelia Can&#39;t Leave the Dukedom\u300f, Bora-young \u300eSignature\u300f, Badger Gukbap \u300eThe only way to break the curse is with you \u2018Only a Contact\u2019, Ham Cho-rong \u300eCrypt Princess\u300f<br><br><strong>\u2694\ufe0fThe choice of true experts! Mr. Blue Martial Arts Comics</strong><br>- The more you watch, the better! Completely unlimited martial arts comics with a flat-rate ticket!<br>- Meet the premium martial arts of the four great martial arts kings Hwang Seong, Ya Seol-rok, Sima Dal, and Ha Seung-nam.<br>- Hwangseong popular comics: \u300e